  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Conquest_The_Kingdoms_Throne/MP_ConquestTheKingdomsThrone_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"900\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><em>全新重大更新 7.0.0</em></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><em>征服王座</em>是一款將您帶入詳細中世紀世界的模組包，透過<span style=\"font-family:inherit; font-style: inherit;\"><em>Conquest</em></span>模組提升生存與建造體驗，該模組加入逼真的紋理、中世紀建築風格以及模擬自然日光的照明系統。包含城堡建造、先進農業、神話生物與具挑戰性的戰鬥等特性，讓玩家能以鐵匠、探險者或自己領土的統治者的身份，擁抱無限可能性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Conquest_The_Kingdoms_Throne/MP_ConquestTheKingdomsThrone_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">在<span style=\"font-family:inherit; font-style: inherit;\"><em>Conquest: The Kingdom's Throne</em></span>中，您不僅能感受到令人驚嘆的中世紀氛圍，更能體驗到更複雜的生存與建造冒險。作為此模組包核心的<span style=\"font-family:inherit; font-style: inherit;\"><em>Conquest</em></span>模組，帶來了令人印象深刻的逼真繪圖風格，重現了真實的中世紀氛圍。憑藉其細緻的紋理系統、中世紀建築模型以及模仿那個時代自然光線的照明系統，<span style=\"font-family:inherit; font-style: inherit;\"><em>Conquest</em></span>完全轉變了 Minecraft 世界，使其中變成了一個宛如夢境般的 medieval 環境。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">除了<span style=\"font-family:inherit; font-style: inherit;\"><em>Conquest</em></span>之外，此模組包還包含多種其他進一步豐富遊戲體驗的模組，例如城堡建設、先進農業、新的神話生物和更具挑戰性的逼真戰鬥系統。玩家可在充滿待發現神秘的世界中鋪建屬於自己的道路，扮演鐵匠、探索古代遺跡、加入公會，或僅僅是建立自己的中世紀領地。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">如果您熱衷於中世紀歷史、細緻建造以及探索一個充滿可能性的世界，這個模組包將是您通往中世紀的完美入口。準備好您的劍，騎上馬背，踏入一個處處等待冒險的世界</span></p>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起遊戲嗎？</strong></span></span></div>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Conquest_The_Kingdoms_Throne/MP_ConquestTheKingdomsThrone_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"350\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即建立您的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">並與朋友一同享受無盡的冒險！凭借卓越的性能和可靠的運行時間，我們的服務器確保每個人都能流暢且愉快地遊戲。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong></a> 可享 <span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Conquest_The_Kingdoms_Throne/MP_ConquestTheKingdomsThrone_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1217043/description_37b875cd-348d-429b-9587-afa7b1f099db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"446\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1217043/description_990006c5-5cd3-408f-ab60-cd69147aaca4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"440\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1217043/description_8c25c6c6-60a6-4a09-b0e7-a25